WEBVTT

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.820
Yuzuki-san was crying...

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.220
<i>And with a pillar right there...</i>

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:45.690
<i>it'll feel like the city is just about to disappear.</i>

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:00.330
If everything disappears...

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:05.540
Will Yuzuki-san's sorrow disappear too?

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:21.510
I'm home, Grandma!

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:22.930
Welcome back!

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:26.600
H-Huh?

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.650
I was thinking of staying over tonight.

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:32.980
Yuzuki-chan is helping me out with dinner.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.400
She's really skilled with a knife.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.820
Oh stop it, Grandma!

00:01:55.300 --> 00:02:00.430
shinjitsu wa hitoe ni kaado no uraomote
Truth and reality are like the two sides of a card

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:05.930
tokenai mama
Forever entwined

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:10.690
mekurimekuru meku
Thrust upon this chaotic stage

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:14.690
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:15.940
memagurushii suteeji de
memagurushii suteeji de
I spin around and lose my way
I spin around and lose my way

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:23.990
sono karamatta kanjou wo manzoku iku made nankai mo
Until I can finally sort out these mixed-up emotions

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:27.250
kowashite shimae
I'll destroy it countless times

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:32.340
unmei ni temaneki sare samayou ashita wa
The uncertain future will be summoned by fate

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:37.630
nani wo erande nani wo tebanashi hitotsu ni nareba iin darou
Should I choose just one thing to let go of?

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:43.390
najitta tefuda wo sarasu yoyuu nante nai yo
I can't afford to let my sinful hand show yet

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:48.480
kawaita koukai no umi wo nomihosu hibi wa
My days of leisurely drinking from the sea of regret are long over

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:53.820
kagirareta kotoba de itsushika no egao yurushite hoshiin darou
Will you really use your one wish to return that lost smile?

00:02:53.980 --> 00:03:00.030
utsutsu wo wasuretatte kamawanai yo dakara
It's no concern of mine if you avert your eyes from reality

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:04.780
ima wa shiranai de itai nee
So please just live in blissful ignorance

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.210
These stewed potatoes are really tasty!

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.590
Why, thank you. Eat as much as you want.

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:22.550
Okay! Ruuko, c'mon and eat some more!

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:24.470
O-Okay...

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:33.600
Is it really okay for Yuzuki-san not to go home?

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:36.980
Whew! That bath felt really good!

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.240
Yuzuki-san...

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:43.490
Stuffed myself with food and took a hot bath. Now I'm Enercharged!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.030
Orichalcum, Attack!

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:48.120
Th-That tickles, Y-Yuzuki-san!

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.410
Take this, and that!
Th-That tickles, Y-Yuzuki-san!

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.540
Th-That tickles, Y-Yuzuki-san!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:54.420
S-Stop it!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.880
Sorry about earlier...

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:01.260
I said some horrible things to you.

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:06.600
<i>I don't know what you're thinking, Ruuko!</i>

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.180
<i>I don't know what she's thinking...</i>

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:17.190
No, it's fine! Don't worry about it.
It doesn't bother me one bit.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.070
You know...

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.910
In my battle against Akira...

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:28.370
I didn't want to lose no matter what.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:29.580
I know.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.500
I...

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.210
have someone that I like.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:38.090
But he'll never return my feelings...

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:44.130
How can you know? I mean, you are cute and all.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:46.680
No, it just won't happen.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.060
It <i>shouldn't</i>...

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:55.310
But if my wish came true,
I could like him just like anyone else...

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:04.610
Wait. Could it be that you like Kazu—

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.910
Attack!

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.960
Oh, stop it already!

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:33.640
I wonder what it feels like to be in love.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.600
I guess it gets you really excited, right?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:39.940
Excited? Excited in battle! Tama!

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:55.830
We had your favorite
okonomiyaki for dinner.
I kept some for you,
so warm it up
tomorrow.
Subject: Dinner
Sender: Kazuki

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.870
Kazuki...

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:01.630
Sender: Akira
Received Mail

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.670
Introduce me to your
friend!
Subject: Hey there!
Sender: Akira

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:08.840
No ignoring, no bullying,
got it?!
Subject: Don't ignore me
Sender: Akira

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.900
Huh? She went home already?

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:23.900
Yeah, like, a while ago.

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:26.610
Okay, thanks.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:33.030
Hitoe-san was writing about decks and battle progression.

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:35.790
So I decided to try to do it, too.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:40.960
That's a good idea. You can look at your deck objectively like that.

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:47.010
Hitoe-san?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.220
She ran away...

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:00.190
Um...

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.520
U-Um, I...

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.110
I...

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:07.490
I would like to be friends with you, Ruuko-san!

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:12.950
I want to be your friend...

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:13.870
Huh?

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.580
Thank you!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.370
Yeah, we're friends!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:26.210
Yuzuki-san, you too!

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:28.130
You don't mind, right?

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.550
Being her friend? Sure, why not?

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:34.970
T-Two friends at once?!

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.980
WIXOSS is so wonderful.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:41.640
Huh?

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:47.860
When I was battling Akira-san, it was so painful that I thought I was going to break.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.450
Yeah, I know that feeling.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:55.030
Selector battles are painful.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:59.790
I thought that was natural since
you're trying to attain your wish.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:06.170
But while I was battling Ruuko-san,
I enjoyed it from the bottom of my heart.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:08.250
Really? Me too!

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:11.220
Well then, let's play a game of WIXOSS to celebrate our friendship.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:13.010
That's a great idea!

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:17.890
B-But, if Selectors battle each other,
someone's wish will...

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.810
No need to worry.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:24.730
As long as Hanayo-san and the others aren't in our decks, we can just hold regular card battles.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.060
O-Oh...

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.610
All right, you three wait here.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:35.610
Have fun, Hitoe.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.280
I will!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.210
Turn end.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.750
It's your turn now, Hitoe-san.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:46.670
Okay!

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.130
I want to play, too!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.760
We did rock-paper-scissors, remember? You're next.

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:52.670
Okay...

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:53.590
Jeez...

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.630
I'll summon Baromet.

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:56.550
Huh?

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.770
U-Um...

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:08.440
Baromet's power is 7000, so won't it get banished by Yuzuki-san's LRIG's ability after it grows?

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:11.150
You're right...

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:17.570
Hey, Ruuko! Stop saying stuff from the sidelines!

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:19.070
I-I'm sorry...

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.660
Tama wants to join!

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.830
Tama and Ruuko are really alike.

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:32.130
I guess Hitoe's wish already came true.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:34.550
She doesn't need to battle anymore.

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:37.760
Are you sure you're okay with that?

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.180
Yeah.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.180
But that means you...

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:44.020
It's fine...

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.730
Not that, Yuzuki!

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:48.350
What?

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:51.730
Ah, I'm sorry. I called you by name.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.230
It's okay, I don't mind.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:57.700
I'm calling you by name already too, y'know?

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:01.990
I can feel your friendship. It's so beautiful.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:06.540
Then why don't you call us by name too, Hitoe-san?

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:10.210
I'll call you "Hitoe," too.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:17.470
O-Okay... Then, R-Ruuko, Yuzuki...

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.300
That feels so weird!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.300
Oh, come on.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.140
It's so weird!

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.600
I haven't seen Hitoe smile like that before.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:29.810
I wish I wasn't her LRIG.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.020
We're not allowed to say that.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:33.860
Right...

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.940
Tama likes Ruu!

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:39.570
I like Ruu. Tama likes being Ruu's LRIG!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:40.820
But...

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:41.740
That's right.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.330
After all, Tama and Ruuko are friends.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:46.790
Yup!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.000
Hanayo, Tama is...

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.710
Yeah, she doesn't know.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.170
I see.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.340
I'm next!

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:01.430
You really like WIXOSS, don't you?

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.970
Yup, I really, really like it!

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:14.940
Right! At the entrance gate!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.400
What happened?

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:17.690
It looks like Akira is here!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.360
You mean the model?

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:20.320
No way!

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:26.950
Aww... Ruu-Ruu went home already?

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.960
That's so mean, breaking a promise like that.

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:33.420
Akira knows Kominato-san?

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.960
Who's Kominato?

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:38.420
How dare she make Akira sad.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.090
No...

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:45.470
Ruu-Ruu didn't do anything bad.
I'll come back again...

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:50.310
But what should I do if she goes home early again?

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:55.230
It'd be great if someone would let Akira know about Ruu-Ruu...

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:56.820
Akira's so gallant!

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.980
I'll do it! I'll let you know for sure!

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.280
I'll do it!

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:01.610
I'll let you know, too!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:07.530
Thank you! Well, I have a shoot I need to go to, so see you!

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:23.340
I don't wanna go home...

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:26.220
You can't be running from Kazuki forever, you know?

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:28.930
But...

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:30.180
Yuzuki!

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:33.640
Akira...

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.440
It looks like Akira came to our school.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:41.860
You're too strong, Ruuko!

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.990
Now then! Milk tea for me!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:46.910
I'll have some sweet bean soup.

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:52.250
Right, right. I come back and all of a sudden I'm the errand boy, huh?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:54.290
Come on already!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.830
Ruuko, you look happier now.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:57.920
Huh?

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:03.630
Next, Ruu-chan is going to battle me. Whoever loses has to clean the bath.

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.390
But Grandma, you're too good!

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:11.350
<i>I wish we could battle and have fun like this all the time.</i>

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:15.940
<i>But...</i>

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:20.770
<i>Battling with Tama is a lot more fun.</i>

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.240
<i>Not just for play.</i>

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:25.950
<i>But in a battlefield.</i>

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:29.700
<i>Battles against Selectors.</i>

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:36.540
<i>But those are battles for everyone's wishes.</i>

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:41.840
I don't have any wishes,
so I shouldn't get in their way.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:43.960
Ruu-chan?

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:47.930
Ah, sorry! It's my turn, right?

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:55.640
Akira-san is looking for me?

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:56.770
Yeah.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.610
She really wants to battle you, Ruuko-san.

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.820
Man, she's so persistent!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:06.110
But I don't have any wishes.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:09.870
Even if I lose to Akira-san,
it won't mean much...

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:10.910
Stop right there!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.700
I'll protect you, so don't you worry.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:16.620
O-Okay...

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:18.870
Listen...

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:22.380
There'll probably be some bad rumors
about you, but just try to ignore them.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.420
She's trying to disturb you as much as she can.

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.340
That won't be a problem.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:31.550
I don't even have any other friends.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:34.720
Ruu-Ruu!

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:36.890
Good morning, Ruu-Ruu.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:39.600
We've been waiting for you.
Let's go to class.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.900
Oh, that's right. I just got a message from Aki-lucky.

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:48.280
She invited us to come down to the photo studio with you.

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:52.450
And she said she'd show us around the studio if we went together.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.700
We might even get to meet Iona—

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:58.120
We can't go. We have something to do after school.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:00.040
You're not invited, so shut it!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:00.870
What?!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.210
C'mon, Ruu-Ruu!

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.710
Let's go!

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.130
Um, but...

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.590
Ruuko...

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:12.010
"There is no stronger bond of friendship than a mutual enemy..."

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:16.140
Okay, that will be it for today. The remainder...

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.430
Ruuko, let's go home!

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:20.310
Yuzuki...

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:22.520
Hey, now...

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:26.730
Can students from other classes please refrain from entering?

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:28.150
We're leaving anyways!

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:28.860
C'mon, Ruuko!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.820
C-Coming...

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:33.990
I won't let you go!

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.990
Hey girls, what are you doing?

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:38.000
Shut it, Scrub-face!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.750
S-Scrub-face?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.420
Don't let them get away!
Send a message to everyone!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.470
There they are!

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:57.970
Go!

00:15:58.350 --> 00:15:59.810
Get out of the way, gramps!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.400
Ruuko, this way!

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.270
Okay!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:18.040
They're <i>really</i> persistent!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:22.750
It's okay, Yuzuki. I'll just go and battle her.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:31.340
Remember how I said that I didn't know what you were thinking?

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:36.850
Well, I do know one thing now for sure.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:42.100
That you really like having WIXOSS battles.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:48.360
Battling Akira is going to be really painful.

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:54.990
Battling her may make you hate WIXOSS.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:58.780
I don't want that to happen.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:16:59.870
Yuzuki...

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:04.710
Did they go this way?

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.630
The freshmen said they saw them.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.920
This is bad.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:12.510
I'll draw them outside, so you stay put here.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:14.680
Huh? But...

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.800
Don't worry. I'll catch you later.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:24.060
There they are!

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:25.690
Don't let them get away!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:42.700
Yuzuki must be really worried about me.

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:49.040
<i>There's no way I can tell her...</i>

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:54.550
<i>That even if I'm hurt or pained...</i>

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:59.140
<i>I </i>want<i> to battle Akira-san...</i>

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.300
Ruu?

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:05.390
Ruu and Tama are same!

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:07.600
Want to battle Akira!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.690
<i>Tama is... scary...</i>

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:19.110
<i>I'm... like Tama.</i>

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:19.870
<i>...scary.</i>

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:25.500
<i>I don't know what Ruuko is thinking about.</i>

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:28.460
<i>She's scary.</i>

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.500
No!

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:35.090
Yuzu—

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:44.100
Ruu-Ruu...

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.220
Found you.

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:51.060
We've brought her!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:55.360
No ways! Seriously? Shucks, thanks!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:57.150
Anything for Aki-lucky!

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.910
You're awesome! Yay!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.830
